 <!-- ================= RAD Appeal ================= -->
<div class="row align-items-center mb-5 flex-column-reverse flex-lg-row-reverse">
  <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-duration="1000">
    <h5 class="fw-bold" style="color:#d80000;">RAD (Refugee Appeal Division) APPEAL</h5>
    <h2 class="fw-bolder mb-3" style="color:#000;">Get a <span style="color:#d80000;">Second Chance</span> with Your Refugee Claim</h2>
    
    <p style="font-size:1.1rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333;">
      If your refugee claim has been refused, <strong>TS Immigration</strong> can help you appeal the decision to the 
      <strong>Refugee Appeal Division (RAD)</strong>. We carefully review your case, identify errors, and prepare strong legal arguments to increase your chances of success. 
      We guide you through every stage of the appeal process.
    </p>
    
    <ul class="list-unstyled mt-3" style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8;">
      <li class="mb-2 hover-li"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2" style="color:#d80000;"></i>Complete documentation & case analysis</li>
      <li class="mb-2 hover-li"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2" style="color:#d80000;"></i>Representation at the Refugee Appeal Division</li>
      <li class="mb-2 hover-li"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2" style="color:#d80000;"></i>Legal accuracy & detailed file review</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3" style="color:#d80000;">Who Can Appeal?</h5>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333;">
      ✔ Individuals whose refugee claim was refused by the IRB.<br>
      ✔ Claimants with the right to appeal under Canadian law.<br>
      ✔ Those with new evidence or legal grounds to challenge the decision.
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3" style="color:#d80000;">What We Assist With</h5>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333;">
      ✔ Reviewing the refusal decision in detail<br>
      ✔ Preparing legal submissions & arguments<br>
      ✔ Collecting new evidence for appeal<br>
      ✔ Filing the RAD application within deadlines
    </p>

  </div>

  <div class="col-lg-6 text-center mb-4 mb-lg-0" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="1000">
    <img src="/public/img/rad appeal.jpeg" 
