      <li class="mb-2 hover-li"><i class="fas fa-check-circle me-2" style="color:#d80000;"></i>Confidential and empathetic guidance</li>
    </ul>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3" style="color:#d80000;">Who Can Apply?</h5>
    <p style="font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.8; color:#333;">
      ✔ Individuals with strong establishment in Canada<br>
      ✔ People facing hardship if returned to home country<br>
      ✔ Families with Canadian-born children<br>
      ✔ Those who cannot qualify through other immigration programs
    </p>

    <h5 class="fw-bold mt-3" style="color:#d80000;">Important Factors Considered</h5>
